Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.91,0:00:03.89,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Did something happen between \Nyou and that part-time guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.35,0:00:22.03,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,A...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:27.17,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Actually, during one of our \Nbreaks at work a while back,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.81,0:00:29.42,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oji-kun asked me if I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:32.14,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,could help him pick out a present \Nfor his sister and so we went.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.12,0:00:34.60,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,And while we were out...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.43,0:00:38.68,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,He... confessed to me, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.41,0:00:42.02,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I {\i1}did{\i0} turn him down on the spot...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.02,0:00:45.15,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,But I wasn't sure if I should \Ntell you about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.00,0:00:49.08,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,So in the end, it came across \Nlike I was trying to hide it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.08,0:00:50.61,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,so I'm sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.48,0:00:53.57,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.06,0:00:55.00,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.95,0:01:02.57,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Senpai... might be a little angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:04.75,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Well, of course he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:08.33,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I wish I'd just told him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.79,0:01:09.53,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.09,0:01:14.60,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Who did you hear this from?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.97,0:01:18.38,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh... Well, from the guy himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.38,0:01:20.11,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Wait, Oji-kun told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.11,0:01:23.52,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well, the other day, when I \Nhappened to go to your shop,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.52,0:01:25.54,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoshiko was with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.77,0:01:29.44,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,And he took it the wrong way, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.44,0:01:30.19,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.19,0:01:32.40,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Who's {\i1}Yoshiko{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.93,0:01:34.12,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Shit...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.57,0:01:37.75,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,No, no, Yoshiko and me aren't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.75,0:01:39.90,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,She's seriously just my childhood friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.90,0:01:41.83,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Please show me a picture of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.83,0:01:42.97,italics,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Insta-worthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.01,0:01:44.62,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.33,0:01:47.00,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,My phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.03,0:01:53.56,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You came to my shop with a girl \NI don't know when I wasn't around...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.99,0:01:56.89,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I really don't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.84,0:02:02.09,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Actually, Yoshiko is \Nafter your dad more than...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.09,0:02:02.98,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.23,0:02:06.48,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It's not your place to talk, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.88,0:02:08.94,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yes it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.29,0:02:13.90,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Because I always put you first, Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.84,0:02:17.32,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's true that I went \Nto eat with Yoshiko,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.32,0:02:19.89,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,but I'll introduce you to her\N whenever you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.89,0:02:21.12,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I wasn't going to hide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.09,0:02:24.22,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,During our summer break,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.60,0:02:27.45,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I figured it made sense that you'd \Nprioritize your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.52,0:02:31.41,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,But it makes me sad that when \Nyou did have extra time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.41,0:02:34.34,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,you spent it with some other \Nguy and not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.75,0:02:35.44,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.89,0:02:37.95,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.03,0:02:40.37,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.37,0:02:41.89,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You don't have to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.53,0:02:45.35,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I don't think you realize \Nit yourself, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:47.81,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,The way you look when you're with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.17,0:02:50.67,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,is a look that you've never shown me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.14,0:02:58.99,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,So if I'm being honest, if he were the \None who'd approached you first...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.97,0:03:03.32,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I think you would have gone \Nout with him instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.83,0:03:07.81,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.14,0:03:11.12,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.88,0:03:14.67,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What? Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.37,0:03:16.51,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:23.36,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,The nerve!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.30,0:03:27.02,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,And to think I was so excited earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.02,0:03:29.22,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I even gathered the courage \Nto go to his room!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.58,0:03:33.19,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,The way he worded that, \Nas if I'd just go out with anyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.79,0:03:36.01,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It pisses me off and makes me so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.51,0:03:41.87,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Every moment since I've started \Ndating Senpai has been so bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.85,0:03:48.46,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,And yet, it turns out I was the only \None who felt we had something special.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.84,0:03:51.04,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I feel so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.19,0:03:58.16,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Ah... Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.91,0:04:04.82,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What the hell was I saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.73,0:04:11.73,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.73,0:04:12.74,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-cha...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.25,0:04:30.83,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Good morning...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.07,0:04:34.70,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:39.26,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.63,0:04:43.52,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Wait, don't tell me you're not \Nwearing your contacts today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.52,0:04:44.92,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.92,0:04:47.73,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I didn't sleep much, \Nso my eyes are really dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.03,0:04:51.60,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan, are you all right?\NCan you even see?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.60,0:04:53.39,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Slightly...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.81,0:04:56.11,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,You've got this whole listless aura...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.44,0:04:58.46,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,You didn't even do your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.46,0:05:00.95,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I just didn't feel like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.84,0:05:04.13,italics,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Oh, something definitely happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.13,0:05:06.16,italics,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Is it even something we could ask about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.89,0:05:10.54,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Hey, Ichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.21,0:05:12.58,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Kuwa, Sentaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.05,0:05:14.60,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,We're gonna go eat ramen, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.60,0:05:15.42,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Wha?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.42,0:05:16.75,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Nah, it's just past eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.75,0:05:17.96,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Is a place even open?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.96,0:05:19.92,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\bord0\c&HF5F1E9&\frx38\fry32\frz338.1\pos(335.334,204.666)}Chinese\h\h\hCuisine
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.65,0:05:19.92,Default,WORKER AT RAMEN PLACE,0,0,0,,Welcome in!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.12,0:05:29.91,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Your ramen's gonna get soggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.91,0:05:31.52,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.17,0:05:35.48,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Wait, don't tell me it \Nwent down like we said?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.87,0:05:40.45,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Huh, what? What went down?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.45,0:05:42.62,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.62,0:05:45.86,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Y'know, I've always been the type \Nof guy who can bounce right back,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.86,0:05:48.91,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,no matter how crappy I feel, just \Nby eating something I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.72,0:05:51.87,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,But right now, I can't \Neven work up an appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.39,0:05:58.29,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Yet you made us skip school for this? \NGive us a break, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.29,0:05:59.19,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.19,0:06:00.53,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.53,0:06:01.51,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.51,0:06:04.09,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Did you do something that made \Nthe Prince angry at you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.33,0:06:10.06,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I did. And I said some awful stuff \Nwithout even thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.33,0:06:13.84,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Truth is, I don't care about\NMr. Handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.43,0:06:16.56,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,He just happened to be the trigger,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.14,0:06:20.00,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,and a petty complaint slipped out.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.99,0:06:26.34,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,372)\blur2\bord0\t(893,1769,\blur0)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H3C5794&\3c&H97A9B6&\move(192,120,192,190,0,3350)}Summer\NFestival
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.99,0:06:26.34,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,372)\blur3\bord1.5\t(893,1769,\blur0)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H97A9B6&\3c&H97A9B6&\move(192,120,192,190,0,3350)}Summer\NFestival
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.41,0:06:29.16,flashback,YOI,0,0,0,,I want you to be completely \Ninfatuated with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.98,0:06:33.09,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,At some point, it felt like I \Nwas the only one feeling this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.89,0:06:35.37,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,So lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.36,0:06:39.30,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I mean, it's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.68,0:06:41.12,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Ever since I started dating Yoi-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.12,0:06:44.17,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm really starting to \Ngive off these "total loser" vibes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.17,0:06:45.80,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Hey, Prince Loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.21,0:06:48.30,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,You want to call it quits?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.89,0:06:50.76,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,You want to stop and \Nmove on to another girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.18,0:06:54.49,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Being the dry, lighthearted, \Nslick Prince Ichimura
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.49,0:06:56.23,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,just like old times?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.94,0:06:58.62,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Just like old times...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.15,0:07:01.65,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What was that like again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.15,0:07:07.07,Default,PRESENT GIRL,0,0,0,,Um!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.40,0:07:08.91,Default,PRESENT GIRL,0,0,0,,Yoi Takiguchi-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.58,0:07:11.54,Default,PRESENT GIRL,0,0,0,,Here! Please accept this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.24,0:07:14.75,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh... Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.62,0:07:18.08,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.08,0:07:20.62,Default,PRESENT GIRL,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for accepting it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.39,0:07:23.88,Default,FRIEND 1 AND 2,0,0,0,,We're always rooting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.87,0:07:28.34,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,This was my norm before \NI met Senpai, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.61,0:07:31.81,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What's this feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.83,0:07:35.31,Default,STORE CLERK,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.31,0:07:36.37,Default,STORE CLERK,0,0,0,,Here's your gyoza.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.72,0:07:37.56,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.95,0:07:52.91,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Thanks for the grub!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.91,0:07:55.34,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Huh? You didn't finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.34,0:07:56.42,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Eat it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.42,0:07:57.79,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,But the bill...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.79,0:07:59.16,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'll spot you next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.24,0:08:03.79,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Huh? What's up with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.92,0:08:06.52,italics,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.52,0:08:08.08,italics,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,A famous shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.08,0:08:09.28,italics,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,A popular one?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.67,0:08:12.54,italics,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Did you really just call \Nme to ask about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.54,0:08:13.60,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.29,0:08:27.49,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Ever since I got her,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.81,0:08:30.04,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I've just come to want more and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.97,0:08:32.48,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I don't want her to hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.02,0:08:34.66,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I don't want to cause her pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.67,0:08:35.41,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,104)\bord1\b1\fs10\c&HF0F1E7&\pos(323.333,157.333)\3c&H9BA33C&}Today
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.67,0:08:35.41,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,104)\bord0\fs8\b1\c&H3E3A34&\pos(491.333,285.333)}Call ended 01:07
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.35,0:08:44.71,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I want to touch her more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.39,0:08:48.66,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I want to kiss her, too, \Nand even go beyond that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.15,0:08:54.14,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I want her to feel the same way I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.50,0:08:56.60,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I want her to...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.09,0:08:59.01,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,fall for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.18,0:09:01.57,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,even more!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.55,0:10:38.99,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Um, Yoi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.00,0:10:43.83,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,You already brought their \Ndrinks a minute ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.65,0:10:47.61,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.61,0:10:50.25,Default,CUSTOMERS,0,0,0,,Oh, no worries at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.83,0:10:54.38,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Yoi-san, did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.23,0:10:58.46,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I mean, you made a \Nlot of mistakes today, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.46,0:11:00.52,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh... Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.23,0:11:04.81,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,It's my fault, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.32,0:11:06.33,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,No, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.33,0:11:07.30,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.17,0:11:09.94,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:12.98,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I didn't want to keep silent,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.41,0:11:15.28,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,if I knew the person I love \Nmight get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.11,0:11:20.66,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for speaking out of turn, \Nafter you already rejected me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.38,0:11:25.25,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.64,0:11:28.96,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,It's hot, so let's lock up\Nand quickly head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:30.93,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Yes, let's.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.75,0:11:39.61,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,So if I'm being honest, if he were the \None who'd approached you first...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.41,0:11:43.84,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I think you would have gone \Nout with him instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.30,0:11:48.56,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I wonder why I chose Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.36,0:11:52.34,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.34,0:11:53.98,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It's the present from this morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.98,0:11:55.95,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I forgot I had it in my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.29,0:11:57.57,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.09,0:12:01.83,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, I hope it didn't break.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.95,0:12:07.39,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.87,0:12:10.99,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Is that a gift from someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.99,0:12:12.84,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.89,0:12:18.05,italics,PRESENT GIRL'S VOICE,0,0,0,,Dear Yoi-sama,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.73,0:12:20.40,italics,PRESENT GIRL'S VOICE,0,0,0,,When I saw this nail polish,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.40,0:12:23.51,italics,PRESENT GIRL'S VOICE,0,0,0,,I thought it would look great on you, \Nso I decided to get it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.91,0:12:27.61,italics,PRESENT GIRL'S VOICE,0,0,0,,Before, I never pictured you \Nwearing things like nail polish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.61,0:12:31.73,italics,PRESENT GIRL'S VOICE,0,0,0,,But lately, I think you've become \Nincredibly cute, Yoi-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.26,0:12:39.74,italics,PRESENT GIRL'S VOICE,0,0,0,,And so, I intend to continue \Nadmiring you from afar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.98,0:12:42.98,italics,PRESENT GIRL'S VOICE,0,0,0,,P.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.56,0:12:46.78,italics,PRESENT GIRL'S VOICE,0,0,0,,Since it came out great,\NI added a photo of you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.25,0:12:50.33,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh? Isn't that covert photography?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.09,0:13:11.65,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Just beyond my gaze...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.97,0:13:20.28,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It's obvious who I'm staring at.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.95,0:13:25.46,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Jeez, I look just like a girl in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.72,0:13:31.68,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,So this is the expression I wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.84,0:13:33.97,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.44,0:13:37.21,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,The uneasy feeling I felt \Nthis morning was from...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.51,0:13:42.80,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Compared to when I was \Nknown as the "Prince"...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.27,0:13:44.50,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,there's a girl who's shy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.50,0:13:45.71,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,and reserved,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.12,0:13:47.37,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,and lazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.85,0:13:50.29,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,and drafts contracts about everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.25,0:13:54.32,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,and inside her head,\Njust like this nail polish,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.79,0:13:58.48,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,there's a shower of \Nfaint pink cherry blossoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.84,0:14:32.14,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Ever since I met Senpai,\NI've felt more like my true self.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.55,0:14:34.60,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Yoi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.10,0:14:41.09,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,A lanky, slender build.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.56,0:14:44.29,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,And a body that easily envelops it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.71,0:14:46.11,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,His deep voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.94,0:14:49.47,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,His much deeper and sweeter voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.01,0:14:53.00,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.47,0:14:58.88,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(260,0)\clip(262,240,269,260)\t(0,260,\clip(262,240,372,260))\blur2\fnComic Sans MS\bord0.5\b1\c&H165687&\3c&H52AFD4&\pos(320,238)}Right now, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.61,0:14:58.88,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Right now, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.56,0:15:04.30,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(882,0)\clip(204,240,209,260)\t(0,882,\clip(204,240,442,260))\blur2\fnComic Sans MS\bord0.5\b1\c&H165687&\3c&H52AFD4&\pos(320,238)}desperately want to see Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.53,0:15:03.65,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,desperately want to see Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.72,0:15:09.71,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Yoi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.28,0:15:16.44,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.63,0:15:26.89,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.43,0:15:32.28,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Um, what is it you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.88,0:15:37.06,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Sorry, handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.89,0:15:40.38,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan is my girlfriend,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.85,0:15:42.50,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,and you're in our way right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.95,0:15:46.68,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.32,0:15:50.12,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,H-Hey, um, Senpai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.26,0:15:53.94,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, could you lock up the shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.84,0:15:56.35,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.49,0:16:06.77,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,What was I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.77,0:16:09.18,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,"Speaking out of turn, \Nafter you already rejected me..."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.65,0:16:11.39,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,After a scene like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.39,0:16:14.37,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,I'm painfully reminded \Nof exactly where I stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.83,0:16:21.92,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.27,0:16:24.72,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Gonna go home and run ten kilometers!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.77,0:16:31.05,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um! Hey, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.00,0:16:33.26,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.14,0:16:36.49,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.59,0:16:39.33,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.56,0:16:43.54,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Sweets from a famous shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.94,0:16:47.65,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Also, this, and this, and this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.97,0:16:50.61,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh, hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.73,0:16:55.76,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um, why did you get so many sweets?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.97,0:17:06.21,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I've...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.53,0:17:10.21,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,never been in a fight with a girl before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.83,0:17:13.66,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,So I don't exactly \Nknow how to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.02,0:17:20.14,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I figured I'd boost my chances \Nby buying you a ton of sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.15,0:17:24.11,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I said some\Nstupid shit and hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.00,0:17:30.57,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I know I was the one who said it, \Nbut seeing you next to him just now...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.57,0:17:33.28,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H4F2BBB&\3c&H15E3CF&\frz354.7\pos(293.333,138.667)\frx348\fry352}Choco Anpan
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.57,0:17:33.28,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord4\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H4F2BBB&\3c&H11A2BD&\frz354.7\pos(293.333,138.667)\frx348\fry352}Choco Anpan
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.36,0:17:33.28,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I really didn't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.27,0:17:37.01,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for being anxious and jealous,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.40,0:17:39.50,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,and acting like a real loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.25,0:17:44.61,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I know it might look like I'm \Ntrying to bribe you with gifts,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.28,0:17:47.09,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,but I'm doing the best I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.41,0:17:58.33,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,So, please stay by my side, Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.73,0:18:05.77,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Seeing Senpai look so sweaty, flustered,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.91,0:18:08.64,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,and totally uncool...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.28,0:18:15.99,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I've never seen him like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.99,0:18:16.99,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.44,0:18:20.80,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.80,0:18:24.04,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Y'know, this makes me super happy and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.04,0:18:26.53,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,but I'm really sweaty right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.53,0:18:27.67,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What's a little sweat?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.20,0:18:29.88,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm sweaty, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.23,0:18:32.84,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.35,0:18:35.80,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,You know you can't stand the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.86,0:18:41.55,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,And yet, there's stuff here that you \Ncan't buy without waiting in a line...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.18,0:18:45.47,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,That one, and that one...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.76,0:18:50.65,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Just to apologize for \Nsomething so small...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.91,0:18:53.31,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He's so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.61,0:18:56.53,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'll have you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.53,0:18:59.14,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I gave it some serious \Nthought after what you said!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.14,0:19:00.41,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.86,0:19:03.57,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,But it's not something I could \Nfigure out just by thinking about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.57,0:19:06.62,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Besides, I wouldn't know what kind \Nof face I have when I'm with Oji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.62,0:19:08.80,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,And it really bugged me that you \Nasked what I would have done
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.80,0:19:10.87,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,if someone else approached me first!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.87,0:19:13.38,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,No, you're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.93,0:19:15.85,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,But for some reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.89,0:19:19.85,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You're the only one who makes \Nme feel this way, Senpai, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.44,0:19:24.81,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,even if it's just because I'm not used to\Nguys, what difference does that make?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.45,0:19:27.69,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm a tomboy, and I happened \Nto be in a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.69,0:19:30.01,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You happened to be there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.01,0:19:31.94,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,We happened to run into each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.94,0:19:34.03,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,got interested, and fell in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.95,0:19:37.24,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Can't that be enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.74,0:19:40.70,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Am I not allowed to call that fate?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.67,0:20:07.81,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.36,0:20:12.02,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I know I just did it,\Nbut I feel like I could die happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.85,0:20:18.99,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,J-Just now, did you—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.99,0:20:20.70,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yep. I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.13,0:20:24.16,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.67,0:20:28.51,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,When someone says something\Nthat cool to you, you just gotta.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.25,0:20:32.70,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I want to be your fate, too, Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.30,0:20:37.05,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.64,0:20:39.90,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.93,0:20:43.66,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,We're not mortal enemies who fell in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.66,0:20:46.45,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,We aren't on board a ship about to sink,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.45,0:20:48.70,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,and the world's not going to end tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.20,0:20:52.56,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It's just a love that happened to come \Ntogether based on chance and timing,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.56,0:20:56.61,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,and maybe "fate" is too grand \Na word for that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.29,0:21:04.13,sign_generic,Credits,0,0,0,,{\fs10\an9\fnTimes New Roman\b1\bord1\blur2\c&HF4DED2&\move(453,360,453,-50,0,4840)\3c&H69472F&}Translation:\NTiming:\NEditing:\NQuality Control:\NFinal Quality Control:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.29,0:21:04.13,sign_generic,Credits,0,0,0,,{\fs10\an7\fnTimes New Roman\b1\bord1\blur2\c&HF4DED2&\move(469.606,360,469.606,-50,0,4840)\3c&H69472F&}Yukari Murase-Louden\NAndy Ellis\NGabriella Alabanza\NSalem Alabanza\NElizabeth Ellis
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.21,0:22:27.51,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fsp2\fscx125\fscy95\fade(2716,1499)\fs10\b1\c&H000000&\bord0\fnArial\pos(340,243.756)}IN THE CLEAR MOONLIT DUSK
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.48,0:22:39.42,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,To start, can we stop\Nby the convenience store?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.86,0:22:41.71,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.93,0:22:44.43,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.95,0:22:48.67,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Even after doing something like that, \Nhe just casually takes my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.09,0:22:53.02,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,And here I am, still feeling like \NI'm floating on air.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.27,0:22:57.37,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Our small fight today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.76,0:23:00.70,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,The ton of sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.70,0:23:03.36,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Senpai's slightly sweat-soaked shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.93,0:23:05.44,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,His big hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.44,0:23:07.57,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,His sulky face.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.56,0:23:10.84,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,The temperature of Senpai's lips.
